<title>USA: National Retail Federation names Martinez chairman.</title>
<headline>National Retail Federation names Martinez chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Retail Federation said Wednesday its executive committee elected Sears, Roebuck and Co chief executive Arthur Martinez as chairman of its board.</p>
<p>Martinez succeeds Spiegel Inc's chief executive John Shea, who will retire from the company on Thursday. Spiegel announced his retirment June 20.</p>
</text>
